# Subdomain consolidation — redirect platform subdomains to the canonical www host.
# These only fire if the subdomain's DNS points to Netlify.
https://api.infamousfreight.com/*      https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!
https://app.infamousfreight.com/*      https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!
https://admin.infamousfreight.com/*    https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!
https://dispatch.infamousfreight.com/* https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!
https://driver.infamousfreight.com/*   https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!
https://broker.infamousfreight.com/*   https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!
https://carrier.infamousfreight.com/*  https://www.infamousfreight.com/:splat  301!

# All other redirects (API proxy, SPA fallback, etc.) are defined in netlify.toml.
# Do NOT add a catch-all SPA fallback here — it would shadow the API proxy rules
# in netlify.toml because _redirects rules are evaluated first.
